  ('activecampaign','activecampaign','ActiveCampaign','email-productivity','gestion','https://www.activecampaign.com','https://try.activecampaign.com/twe5oenri4zv-b9q17i','','https://active-campaign.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/general/AC_Opengraph-1.png?w=1200&amp;h=630&amp;q=82&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=clip&amp;dm=1753306175&amp;s=1b0f698fac52d45ef9b2f8a250d6f8f5','Email marketing, automation et CRM marketing pour PME orientées conversion.','Email marketing, automation and marketing CRM for conversion-focused SMBs.','ActiveCampaign est un outil d’automation marketing plus avancé qu’une simple newsletter. ToolTrim le recommande seulement si tu as déjà des segments, scénarios ou cycles de vente à automatiser. Sinon, Brevo, Kit ou Mailchimp peuvent être plus simples et moins lourds.','ActiveCampaign is a deeper marketing automation platform than a simple newsletter tool. ToolTrim recommends it when segmentation and customer journeys are real.','{"free":"Essai gratuit selon offre.","paid":"Plans publics à partir d’environ 15 $/mois, prix selon contacts et modules."}'::jsonb,'{"free":"Free trial depending on current offer.","paid":"Public plans start around $15/month, with price depending on contacts and modules."}'::jsonb,15,'{"compare_price_monthly_eur":15,"compare_plan_name":"Starter","compare_plan_kind":"paid","price_reliability":"public_pricing_or_public_entry_plan","location_sensitive":true,"usage_sensitive":true,"cautions":["Le prix évolue avec le nombre de contacts et les modules marketing/CRM."],"source_domain":"activecampaign.com","official_source_url":"https://www.activecampaign.com/pricing","verified_on":"2026-05-03","verification_status":"verified_public_pricing_page"}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Tu as plusieurs segments et parcours à automatiser.","Ton email marketing influence directement les ventes."],"avoidIf":["Tu veux juste envoyer une newsletter mensuelle.","Tu n’as pas encore assez de contacts qualifiés."],"threshold":"À choisir quand l’automation rapp