Cut already IS largely an AI editing tool, not just a classic editor. Captioning, automatic framing, and audio cleanup are handled by built-in AI. Verdict: CapCut absorbed AI rather than being challenged by it.","aiTools":[]}}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["montage-video-court","sous-titrage","social-media","design-visuel","creator-workflow"]'::jsonb,'["createur-contenu"]'::jsonb,'["sofia","alix"]'::jsonb,null,null,null,null,null,null,5,true,'question',null,'["cluster-trop-large"]'::jsonb,'["publishing_frequency","team_requirement","distribution_requirement"]'::jsonb,'content-creation','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,null,null,null),
