  ('chatgpt','chatgpt','ChatGPT','ai-general','ia','https://chat.openai.com','https://chat.openai.com','','https://tooltrim.com/og-screenshots/chatgpt.png','L''assistant IA généraliste d''OpenAI.','The general-purpose AI assistant from OpenAI.','ChatGPT, c''est l''assistant IA généraliste d''OpenAI. À partir de 17.32€/mois. Pensé pour les graphistes et les créateurs vidéo.

Version gratuite déjà très performante (GPT-3.5). polyvalence totale : rédaction, code, analyse, traduction, idéation, interface simple et intuitive. Mémoire de conversation pour contexte long. Concrètement : rédaction : générer des brouillons d''emails, articles, posts LinkedIn. Ou encore : brainstorming : générer des idées de contenu, noms de projets, angles d''articles. Gain de temps estimé : 7h/mois.

À garder si : usage intensif (>10h/semaine) ou besoin de raisonnement complexe (GPT-4). À éviter si : usage ponctuel ou recherches simples. Limite principale : peut générer des informations incorrectes (hallucinations). Dès que l''attente ou les erreurs de la version gratuite vous font perdre 1h/semaine.','ChatGPT is the general-purpose AI assistant from OpenAI. Starting at €17.32/month. Built for graphic designers and video creators.

Free version already highly performant (GPT-3.5). total versatility: writing, code, analysis, translation, ideation, simple and intuitive interface. Conversation memory for long context. In practice: writing: generate drafts for emails, articles, and LinkedIn posts. Also: brainstorming: generate content ideas, project names, and article angles. Estimated time saving: 7h/month.

Keep it if: intensive use (>10h/week) or need for complex reasoning (GPT-4). Skip it if: occasional use or simple searches. Main limit: can generate incorrect information (hallucinations). As soon as wait times or errors in the free version cost you 1 hour per week.','{"free":"Plan gratuit disponible","paid":"20$/mois (Plus)"}'::jsonb,'{"free":"Free plan available","paid":"$20 USD/month (Plus)"}'::jsonb,17.32,'{"cautions":["confirm_if_paid_plan_is_really_used"],"verified_on":"2026-03-13","source_domain":"openai.com","usage_sensitive":false,"compare_plan_kind":"individual","compare_plan_name":"Plus","price_reliability":"high","location_sensitive":false,"official_source_url":"https://openai.com/chatgpt/pricing/","verification_status":"official_explicit","compare_price_monthly_eur":17.32}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Usage intensif (>10h/semaine)","Besoin de raisonnement complexe (GPT-4)","Besoin d''analyse de données"],"avoidIf":["Usage ponctuel","Recherches simples","Budget serré"],"threshold":"Dès que l''attente ou les erreurs de la version gratuite vous font perdre 1h/semaine."}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Intensive use (>10h/week)","Need for complex reasoning (GPT-4)","Need for data analysis"],"avoidIf":["Occasional use","Simple searches","Tight budget"],"threshold":"As soon as wait times or errors in the free version cost you 1 hour per week."}'::jsonb,'["Version gratuite déjà très performante (GPT-3.5)","Polyvalence totale : rédaction, code, analyse, traduction, idéation","Interface simple et intuitive","Mémoire de conversation pour contexte long","GPT-4 (version Plus) nettement plus intelligent"]'::jsonb,'["Free version already highly performant (GPT-3.5)","Total versatility: writing, code, analysis, translation, ideation","Simple and intuitive interface","Conversation memory for long context","GPT-4 (Plus version) significantly more intelligent"]'::jsonb,'["Peut générer des informations incorrectes (hallucinations)","Version gratuite limitée en période de forte demande","Nécessite de bien formuler les prompts pour de bons résultats"]'::jsonb,'["Can generate incorrect information (hallucinations)","Free version limited during periods of high demand","Requires well-formulated prompts for good results"]'::jsonb,'["generation-texte","brainstorming","analyse","assistant-generaliste"]'::jsonb,'["Rédaction : générer des brouillons d''emails, articles, posts LinkedIn","Brainstorming : générer des idées de contenu, noms de projets, angles d''articles","Recherche : résumer des articles longs, extraire les points clés","Code : déboguer, expliquer, ou générer du code","Formation : apprendre de nouveaux concepts avec des explications simplifiées"]'::jsonb,'["Writing: generate drafts for emails, articles, and LinkedIn posts","Brainstorming: generate content ideas, project names, and article angles","Research: summarize long articles and extract key points","Code: debug, explain, or generate code","Training: learn new concepts with simplified explanations"]'::jsonb,'["writer","consultant","tech","designer","content-creator","other"]'::jsonb,'{"metaDescription":"ChatGPT gratuit ou Plus (20€/mois) ? Découvrez quand payer pour GPT-4 vaut vraiment le coup pour votre activité freelance. Analyse objective.","aiAngle":{"stance":"challenge","augmentFr":"ChatGPT reste le généraliste de référence (rédaction, code, analyse, brainstorm), mais des outils verticaux spécialisés (Claude pour le code complexe, Perplexity pour la recherche, Midjourney pour l''image) le devancent souvent sur leur tâche précise.","augmentEn":"ChatGPT remains the reference generalist (writing, code, analysis, brainstorming), but specialized vertical tools (Claude for complex code, Perplexity for research, Midjourney for images) often outperform it on their specific task.","replaceFr":"ChatGPT challenge-t-il les métiers créatifs et de rédaction ? Partiellement : il accélère la production de premiers jets, mais la pertinence, la vérification des faits et la voix de marque restent un travail humain. Verdict : ChatGPT augmente la productivité de l''utilisateur généraliste, sans remplacer l''expertise verticale.","replaceEn":"Does ChatGPT challenge creative and writing jobs? Partly: it speeds up first drafts, but relevance, fact-checking, and brand voice remain human work. Verdict: ChatGPT augments the generalist user''s productivity, without replacing vertical expertise.","aiTools":["claude","perplexity","gemini"]}}'::jsonb,'[{"slug":"chatgpt-plus-utile-ou-inutile","title":"ChatGPT Plus : utile ou inutile pour freelance ?","excerpt":"Tout le monde en parle, mais avez-vous vraiment besoin de payer 20$ par mois ? Analyse froide pour solopreneurs."}]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["generation-texte","brainstorming","analyse","assistant-generaliste"]'::jsonb,'["graphiste-da","motion-video","consultant-b2b","developpeur-solo","ai-builder","newslettiste-auteur","createur-contenu"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'chatgpt',null,null,'high','medium',7,true,'ferme','{"mode":"replace_for_cost","action":"replace","confidence":"medium","verified_on":"2026-03-13","price_alt_eur":14.43,"price_tool_eur":17.32,"gain_annual_eur":34.68,"gain_monthly_eur":2.89,"replacement_tool":"claude"}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'ai-text-generalist','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,'["generation-texte","brainstorming","analyse","assistant-generaliste"]'::jsonb,null,null),
