Keep it if: you are building an email list (+500 subscribers) or you want to automate your marketing campaigns. Skip it if: you don''t have an email list yet or you send fewer than 2 newsletters per month. As soon as you have more than 200 subscribers and want to automate your email marketing. Free alternative: brevo.','{"free":"Gratuit jusqu''à 500 contacts","paid":"19$/mois (Email Marketing) à 99$/mois (Marketing Automation)"}'::jsonb,'{"free":"Free for up to 500 contacts","paid":"$19/month (Email Marketing) to $99/month (Marketing Automation)"}'::jsonb,12.99,'{"cautions":["confirm_if_paid_plan_is_really_used"],"verified_on":"2026-03-13","source_domain":"getresponse.com","usage_sensitive":false,"compare_plan_kind":"seat","compare_plan_name":"Entry paid plan","price_reliability":"high","location_sensitive":false,"official_source_url":"https://www.getresponse.com/pricing","verification_status":"official_explicit","compare_price_monthly_eur":12.99}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Vous construisez une liste email (+500 abonnés)","Vous voulez automatiser vos campagnes marketing","Vous vendez des produits/services en ligne","Vous cherchez une alternative à Mailchimp moins chère"],"avoidIf":["Vous n''avez pas encore de liste email","Vous envoyez moins de 2 newsletters par mois","Vous préférez des outils spécialisés (ConvertKit pour créateurs)"],"threshold":"Dès que vous avez +200 abonnés et que vous voulez automatiser votre marketing par email."}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["You are building an email list (+500 subscribers)","You want to automate your marketing campaigns","You sell products/services online","You are looking for a cheaper alternative to Mailchimp"],"avoidIf":["You don''t have an email list yet","You send fewer than 2 newsletters per month","You prefer specialized tools (ConvertKit for creators)"],"threshold":"As soon as you have more than 200 subscribers and want to automate your email marketing."}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'[]'::jsonb,null,'["email","marketing-email","prosp