 faster doesn''t remove the need to version it, review it as a team, and run a CI/CD pipeline. AI changes how code gets written, not how it gets managed. Verdict: GitHub stays the essential plumbing, even when AI writes the code.","aiTools":["github-copilot","cursor","windsurf"]}}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["versioning-code","code-review","ci-cd"]'::jsonb,'["developpeur-solo","cto-lead-tech","ai-builder"]'::jsonb,'["theo","alix","marc"]'::jsonb,null,null,null,null,null,null,5,false,'silence',null,'["pas-de-remplacement-valide","auto-replace-bloqué","non-substituable"]'::jsonb,'["team_seats","timeline_requirement","docs_requirement","client_collaboration"]'::jsonb,'dev-issue-tracker','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":false,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":"Couche non substituable par défaut.","requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,null,null,null),
