À garder si : vidéos explicatives ou cours sans apparaître à la caméra. À éviter si : contenu authentique — un vrai visage reste plus engageant. Rentable dès 4 vidéos d''avatars par mois.','HeyGen is video creation with AI avatars and automatic translation. Starting at €25.11/month. Built for content creators and coaches and trainers.

Estimated time saving: 5h/month.

Keep it if: explainer videos or courses without appearing on camera. Skip it if: authentic content — a real face remains more engaging. Profitable starting from 4 avatar videos per month.','{"free":"1 vidéo/mois","paid":"29$/mois (Creator)"}'::jsonb,'{"free":"1 video/month","paid":"$29/month (Creator)"}'::jsonb,25.11,'{"cautions":[],"verified_on":"2026-03-13","source_domain":"heygen.com","usage_sensitive":false,"compare_plan_kind":"seat","compare_plan_name":"Entry paid plan","price_reliability":"high","location_sensitive":false,"official_source_url":"https://www.heygen.com/pricing","verification_status":"official_explicit","compare_price_monthly_eur":25.11}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Vidéos explicatives ou cours sans apparaître à la caméra"],"avoidIf":["Contenu authentique — un vrai visage reste plus engageant"],"threshold":"Rentable dès 4 vidéos d''avatars par mois."}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Explainer videos or courses without appearing on camera"],"avoidIf":["Authentic content — a real face remains more engaging"],"threshold":"Profitable starting from 4 avatar videos per month."}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'[]'::jsonb,null,'["generation-video","traduction-video","avatar-ia"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'[]'::jsonb,'{}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["generation-video","creation-cours"]'::jsonb,'["createur-contenu","coach-formateur","ai-builder"]'::jsonb,'["sofia","theo","alix"]'::jsonb,null,null,null,null,null,null,5,true,'question',null,'["pas-de-remplacement-valide"]'::jsonb,'["primary_ai_tasks","daily_usage_intensity","team_requirement","privacy_requirement"]'::jsonb,'ai-avatar-video','{"auto_cancel_allowed":true,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,'["generation-video","avatar-ia"]'::jsonb,null,null),
  ('hibob','hibob','HiBob','hris-payroll','metier','https://www.hibob.com','https://www.hibob.com','','https://res.cloudinary.com/hibob-website-prod/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1765722016/wp-website/New-Homepage-sharing-banner/New-Homepage-sharing-banner.png?_i=AA','HiBob structure les données collaborateurs, RH ou paie dans une stack d''entreprise.','HiBob structures employee, HR, or payroll data in a company stack.','HiBob devient utile quand les arrivées, départs, managers, équipes ou droits doivent rester synchronisés avec les outils métiers. Pour une petite équipe, la valeur vient surtout de la réduction des tâches RH répétitives ; pour une entreprise, c''est un référentiel à ne pas multiplier inutilement.','HiBob becomes useful when joiners, leavers, managers, teams, or permissions need to stay synced with business tools. For a small team, value mostly comes from reducing repetitive HR work; for larger organizations, it is a system of record that should not be duplicated unnecessarily.','{"free":"Non communiqué","paid":"Sur devis / prix non public"}'::jsonb,'{"free":"Not disclosed","paid":"Custom pricing / no public baseline"}'::jsonb,0,'{"compare_price_monthly_eur":0,"compare_plan_name":"Prix non public","compare_plan_kind":"custom","price_reliability":"official_context_required","usage_sensitive":true,"location_sensitive":false,"cautions":["Prix dépendant du plan, du pays, du volume ou du contrat. À vérifier sur la page officielle avant décision."],"source_domain":"hibob.com","verified_on":"2026-05-02","official_source_url":"https://www.hibob.com","verification_status":"needs_official_quote"}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["L’outil est déjà une source de vérité dans l’organisation","Plusieurs équipes dépendent de la donnée synchronisée","Le coût de désalignement dépasse le coût de licence"],"avoidIf":["Usage ponctuel ou simple curiosité","Process encore gérable avec un outil plus léger","Doublon avec un référentiel déjà en place"],"threshold":"À garder si HiBob évite des erreurs RH récurrentes ou sert déjà de source de vérité collaborateurs."}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["The tool is already a system of record in the organization","Several teams depend on synchronized data","The cost of misalignment is higher than the license cost"],"avoidIf":["Occasional use or curiosity only","The process is still manageable with a lighter tool","It overlaps with an existing system of record"],"threshold":"Keep HiBob if it prevents recurring HR errors or already acts as the employee source of truth."}'::jsonb,'["Centralise les données collaborateurs","Réduit les erreurs lors des arrivées et départs","Aide les workflows de validation RH"]'::jsonb,'["Centralizes employee data","Reduces mistakes during onboarding and offboarding","Supports HR approval workflows"]'::jsonb,'["Peut doublonner avec un outil RH déjà en place","Paramétrage sensible aux règles internes","Prix souvent dépendant du nombre de salariés"]'::jsonb,'["Can overlap with an existing HR tool","Setup depends heavily on internal rules","Pricing often depends on headcount"]'::jsonb,'["hris-sync"]'::jsonb,'["Synchroniser organigrammes et managers","Gérer les arrivées et départs","Aligner validations, paie et données RH"]'::jsonb,'["Sync org charts and managers","Manage onboarding and offboarding","Align approvals, payroll, and HR data"]'::jsonb,'["hr","ops","scaleup","enterprise"]'::jsonb,'{"metaDescription":"HiBob : fiche ToolTrim avec usage, limites, alternatives et points de vigilance pour décider si l''outil mérite sa place dans votre stack."}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["hris-sync"]'::jsonb,'["business-ops","finance-ops","enterprise-ops"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,null,null,'{"available":false,"freeTier":null}'::jsonb,'low','high',null,true,'question',null,'["Prix et périmètre à confirmer selon contrat."]'::jsonb,'["team_size","current_system_of_record","integration_need"]'::jsonb,'hris-sync','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":false,"auto_downgrade_allowed":false,"require