","replaceEn":"Replace Indy with an AI? No: a French freelancer''s administrative management (compliant invoicing, contracts, declarations) remains a regulated need. AI helps write faster, it doesn''t replace administrative compliance. Verdict: AI augments writing, admin management remains the product.","aiTools":[]}}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["shine"]'::jsonb,'["facturation","paiements","comptabilite","paie"]'::jsonb,'["consultant-b2b","graphiste-da","photographe","motion-video"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'indy',null,null,'high','medium',2,true,'question',null,'["pas-de-remplacement-valide","cluster-trop-large"]'::jsonb,'["monthly_revenue","country_compliance","bank_sync_needed"]'::jsonb,'finance-ops','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,null,null,null),
  ('infisical','infisical','Infisical','security','core','','','',null,'Gestion de secrets open-source pour équipes dev.','Open-source secret management for dev teams.','Infisical, c''est gestion de secrets open-source pour équipes dev. Gratuit pour commencer, payant pour aller plus loin.

Open-source et self-hostable. interface moderne et intuitive, intégrations CI/CD complètes. SDK pour Node, Python, Go, etc. Concrètement : centraliser les secrets sans dépendance cloud. Ou encore : intégrer la gestion de secrets dans le CI/CD.

