Specialized in business loans, and professional interface. Estimated time saving: 2h/month.

Keep it if: regular use or essential features. Skip it if: occasional use or tight budget. Main limit: price to be verified based on usage. Free, keep it if it''s useful.','{"free":"Toutes les fonctionnalités","paid":"Version payante disponible"}'::jsonb,'{"free":"All features","paid":"Paid version available"}'::jsonb,0,'{"cautions":["confirm_if_paid_plan_is_really_used"],"verified_on":"2026-03-13","source_domain":"lendio.com","usage_sensitive":false,"compare_plan_kind":"seat","compare_plan_name":"Free","price_reliability":"low","location_sensitive":false,"official_source_url":"https://lendio.com","verification_status":"official_site_only","compare_price_monthly_eur":0}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Usage régulier","Fonctionnalités essentielles"],"avoidIf":["Usage ponctuel","Budget serré"],"threshold":"Gratuit, à garder si utile"}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Regular use","Essential features"],"avoidIf":["Occasional use","Tight budget"],"threshold":"Free, keep it if it''s useful"}'::jsonb,'["Spécialisé en business loans","Interface professionnelle"]'::jsonb,'["Specialized in business loans","Professional interface"]'::jsonb,'["Prix à vérifier selon usage"]'::jsonb,'["Price to be verified based on usage"]'::jsonb,'["business loans"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'["all"]'::jsonb,'{"metaDescription":"Lendio : Service de prêts professionnels avec multiples options de financement. Découvrez si cet outil vaut le coup pour votre activité freelance."}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["business loans"]'::jsonb,'["consultant-b2b","daf-finance"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,null,null,null,'high','medium',2,true,'question',null,'["pas-de-remplacement-valide","cluster-trop-large"]'::jsonb,'["monthly_revenue","country_compliance","bank_sync_needed"]'::jsonb,'finance-ops','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,null,null,null