ated: it''s payment infrastructure, not a content product. AI builders (Lovable, bolt.new) actually integrate Stripe by default to monetize a generated app. Verdict: the rise of AI apps strengthens demand for Stripe.","aiTools":["lovable","bolt-new"]}}'::jsonb,'[{"slug":"stripe-vs-virement","title":"Stripe vs Virement : le coût caché du gratuit","excerpt":"Stripe prend 1,5% + 0,25€. Le virement est gratuit. Le choix semble vite vu. Pas si vite."}]'::jsonb,'["paypal"]'::jsonb,'["facturation","paiements","comptabilite","paie"]'::jsonb,'["fondateur-saas","ecommercant","coach-formateur","developpeur-solo"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'stripe',null,null,'high','medium',2,true,'question',null,'["pas-de-remplacement-valide","cluster-trop-large"]'::jsonb,'["monthly_revenue","country_compliance","bank_sync_needed"]'::jsonb,'finance-ops','{"auto_cancel_allowed":false,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,true,null,null,null),
