Blazing speed: everything is done via keyboard. email tracking (read receipts), remind Me: automatic reminders if there is no response. Split Inbox: automatically sort your emails. In practice: prospecting: track the opening of your sales emails. Also: customer follow-up: automatic reminders for unanswered emails. Estimated time saving: 3h/month.

Keep it if: you receive +50 real emails per day or email is your primary work tool. Skip it if: you have fewer than 10 emails per day or the price ($30/month) is a shock to you. Main limit: high price: 30€/month. As soon as email becomes your primary bottleneck.','{"free":"Pas de plan gratuit permanent","paid":"Starter 30$/mois ou 300$/an; Business 40$/mois ou 396$/an"}'::jsonb,'{"free":"No permanent free plan","paid":"Starter $30/month or $300/year; Business $40/month or $396/year"}'::jsonb,25.98,'{"cautions":[],"verified_on":"2026-03-13","source_domain":"help.superhuman.com","usage_sensitive":false,"compare_plan_kind":"seat","compare_plan_name":"Starter","price_reliability":"high","location_sensitive":false,"official_source_url":"https://superhuman.com/help","verification_status":"official_explicit","compare_price_monthly_eur":21.65}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Vous recevez +50 vrais emails par jour","L''email est votre outil de travail principal","Vous connaissez les raccourcis clavier"],"avoidIf":["Vous avez moins de 10 emails par jour","Le prix (30$/mois) vous choque"],"threshold":"Dès que l''email devient votre goulot d''étranglement principal."}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["You receive +50 real emails per day","Email is your primary work tool","You know the keyboard shortcuts"],"avoidIf":["You have fewer than 10 emails per day","The price ($30/month) is a shock to you"],"threshold":"As soon as email becomes your primary bottleneck."}'::jsonb,'["Vitesse fulgurante : tout se fait au clavier","Suivi d''ouverture des emails (read receipts)","Remind Me : rappel automatique si pas de réponse","Split Inbox : trier automatiquement vos emails","Interface minimaliste et élégante"]'::jsonb,'["Blazing speed: everything is done via keyboard","Email tracking (read receipts)","Remind Me: automatic reminders if there is no response","Split Inbox: automatically sort your emails","Minimalist and elegant interface"]'::jsonb,'["Prix élevé : 30€/mois","Courbe d''apprentissage pour maîtriser les raccourcis","Fonctionne uniquement avec Gmail et Outlook"]'::jsonb,'["High price: 30€/month","Learning curve to master shortcuts","Only works with Gmail and Outlook"]'::jsonb,'["email","gestion-inbox","suivi-emails"]'::jsonb,'["Prospection : suivre l''ouverture de vos emails commerciaux","Suivi client : rappels automatiques pour les emails sans réponse","Inbox Zero : traiter vos emails 2x plus vite avec raccourcis","Collaboration : partager des emails avec votre équipe","Productivité : réduire le temps passé dans les emails de 30-50%"]'::jsonb,'["Prospecting: track the opening of your sales emails","Customer follow-up: automatic reminders for unanswered emails","Inbox Zero: process your emails 2x faster with shortcuts","Collaboration: share emails with your team","Productivity: reduce time spent on emails by 30-50%"]'::jsonb,'["consultant","tech","other"]'::jsonb,'{"metaDescription":"Superhuman : L''expérience email la plus rapide au monde. Découvrez si cet outil vaut le coup pour votre activité freelance.","aiAngle":{"stance":"augmente","augmentFr":"Superhuman a construit sa proposition de valeur récente autour de l''IA (rédaction de réponses, tri automatique, résumé de fils) en plus de sa rapidité historique — l''IA est devenue un argument central de vente, pas juste un ajout.","augmentEn":"Superhuman built its recent value proposition around AI (drafting replies, automatic triage, thread summaries) on top of its historical speed — AI has become a central selling point, not just an add-on.","replaceFr":"Remplacer Superhuman par une IA ? La question est presque inversée : Superhuman EST en grande partie une expérience email construite autour de l''IA. Sans son moteur IA, il reste un client mail rapide ; avec, c''est ce qui justifie son prix premium face à Gmail gratuit. Verdict : l''IA est devenue le produit principal, pas un simple ajout.","replaceEn":"Replace Superhuman with an AI? The question is almost inverted: Superhuman IS largely an email experience built 