  ('sysaid','sysaid','SysAid','organization','satellite','https://sysaid.com','https://sysaid.com','','https://cdn.sysaid.com/wp-content/uploads/sysaid-logo-blogs.png','Logiciel ITSM (IT Service Management) avec helpdesk, gestion des actifs et workflows ITIL — prix sur devis uniquement.','ITSM platform with help desk, asset management, and ITIL workflows — quote-only pricing.','SysAid est une plateforme ITSM complète qui couvre le cycle de vie des tickets (incidents, demandes, problèmes, changements), la gestion des actifs IT (CMDB), un portail self-service pour les utilisateurs finaux et des automatisations basées sur des règles métier. Compatible ITIL, il s''adresse aux DSI de PME et ETI qui veulent structurer leur support sans recourir à ServiceNow ou Jira Service Management. Disponible en SaaS cloud et en déploiement on-premise, SysAid n''affiche aucun tarif public — tout passe par un devis commercial.','SysAid is a full ITSM platform covering the complete ticket lifecycle (incidents, requests, problems, changes), IT asset management (CMDB), an end-user self-service portal, and rule-based automation. ITIL-compatible and aimed at SME and mid-market IT departments that want structured service management without the complexity of ServiceNow or Jira Service Management. Available as cloud SaaS or on-premise. SysAid publishes no public pricing — all tiers require a sales quote.','{"free":"Aucun plan gratuit : SysAid propose uniquement un essai de 30 jours. Aucun accès permanent sans contrat.","paid":"Tarification sur devis. Tier Help Desk : environ 1 200–1 500 $/an pour 3 agents et 250 actifs (estimation marché). Tier ITSM et ITSM+ : à partir de ~3 000–6 000 $/an selon agents et modules. Déploiement on-premise et cloud disponibles à des tarifs différents."}'::jsonb,'{"free":"No free plan: SysAid offers a 30-day trial only. No permanent access without a paid contract.","paid":"Quote-based pricing only. Help Desk tier: ~$1,200–1,500/year for 3 agents and 250 assets (market estimate). ITSM and ITSM+ tiers: from ~$3,000–6,000/year depending on agents and modules. On-premise and cloud deployments priced differently."}'::jsonb,10,'{"compare_plan_kind":"custom","compare_price_monthly_eur":0,"cautions":["Tarification sur devis — demander un chiffrage avant toute comparaison.","Le coût on-premise inclut des frais d''infrastructure supplémentaires."],"cautionsEn":["Quote-only pricing — request a quote before any comparison.","On-premise cost includes additional infrastructure fees."]}'::jsonb,'{"keepIf":["Usage régulier","Fonctionnalités essentielles"],"avoidIf":["Usage ponctuel","Budget serré"],"threshold":"Dès que l''outil vous fait gagner plus de 10€/mois"}'::jsonb,'{"score":68,"label":"Mixed","summary":"SysAid is a solid, ITIL-complete ITSM for SME IT teams, but the lack of public pricing and an ageing interface are real disadvantages against Freshservice.","keepIf":["Your IT department manages 100+ endpoints and needs a CMDB integrated with ticketing.","On-premise deployment is required for regulatory reasons.","Your team follows ITIL processes (incidents, problems, changes)."],"avoidIf":["You''re already on Jira SM or Freshservice with a working CMDB.","You need a quick pricing estimate — SysAid requires a sales call.","Your IT team has fewer than 5 agents (functional overkill)."],"threshold":"Cost-effective from ~5 IT agents managing 300+ assets, provided you negotiate the annual rate.","billingTraps":["The 30-day trial only surfaces a subset of modules — some ITSM+ features only appear post-contract.","On-premise pricing is consistently higher than SaaS for the same capacity.","Add-on modules (advanced asset discovery, BI reporting) are billed separately from the base fee."],"tcoExampleEn":"For an IT team of 8 agents managing 500 endpoints: expect ~$4,000–6,000/year on the ITSM tier (estimate). Add 10–15% for Active Directory integration and initial training."}'::jsonb,'["ITSM complet et ITIL-ready sans complexité ServiceNow","Gestion des actifs (CMDB) incluse dans tous les tiers","Option on-premise pour les contraintes de souveraineté des données","Portail self-service configurable sans code"]'::jsonb,'["Full ITSM and ITIL-ready without ServiceNow complexity","Asset management (CMDB) included across all tiers","On-premise option for data sovereignty requirements","Configurable self-service portal, no coding needed"]'::jsonb,'["Aucun tarif public — impossible de budgéter sans contact commercial","Interface datée comparée à Freshservice ou Jira SM","Montée en charge coûteuse sur les tiers ITSM/ITSM+","Intégrations tierces limitées sur les tiers bas de gamme"]'::jsonb,'["No public pricing — impossible to budget without a sales call","Dated UI compared to Freshservice or Jira SM","Significant cost jump when scaling to ITSM/ITSM+ tiers","Third-party integrations limited on lower tiers"]'::jsonb,'["IT service management"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,'["all"]'::jsonb,'{"metaDescription":"SysAid : Logiciel de gestion des services IT (ITSM). Découvrez si cet outil vaut le coup pour votre activité freelance.","idealForFr":"DSI de PME (50–500 salariés) cherchant un ITSM complet avec ticketing ITIL, CMDB intégrée et option on-premise, sans la complexité de ServiceNow.","idealForEn":"SME IT departments (50–500 employees) seeking a full ITSM with ITIL ticketing, integrated CMDB, and on-premise option, without ServiceNow''s complexity."}'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'["IT service management"]'::jsonb,'["manager-dsi","cto-lead-tech"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,null,null,null,null,'high','high',3,true,'question',null,'["cluster-trop-large"]'::jsonb,'["team_seats","guest_clients","approvals_needed"]'::jsonb,null,'{"auto_cancel_allowed":true,"auto_replace_allowed":true,"default_decision_lane":"review_then_prescribe","auto_downgrade_allowed":true,"never_auto_cancel_reason":null,"requires_context_questions":true}'::jsonb,null,false,null,null,null),
